      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We describe two cases of iatrogenic adult diaphragmatic hernias with incarceration which occurred postoperatively and led to an acute abdomen. The pathogenesis, clinical findings, the often challenging diagnostics and the therapeutic management of this rare condition are discussed."},
